<title>FINLAND: TIETO SAYS BOUGHT SUOMEN PICA-DATA.</title>
<headline>TIETO SAYS BOUGHT SUOMEN PICA-DATA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish data services group TT Tieto Oy said on Friday its TT-Tietopalvelut Oy unit had acquired direct marketing services company Suomen Pica-Data Oy at an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;The deal supplements services particularly in direct marketing to vehicle business and in business-to-business direct marketing,&quot; Tieto said in a statement.</p>
<p>Pica-Data's net sales were 5.3 million markka in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
